# This repository has TWO separate env files. Nothing is read from this root file.
#   server/.env.example   -> copy to server/.env      (server secrets: Gemini key, mandi key, CORS origin)
#   client/.env.example  -> copy to client/.env.local (only the public server URL; never secrets)
# Real values go in the local .env files or in the Render / Vercel dashboards. Never commit them.
